{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_208_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_208","textTraditional":"一、二十有七年，春，公如齊。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_208_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_208","textTraditional":"二、公至自齊，居於鄆。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_208_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_208","textTraditional":"公在外也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_208_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_208","textTraditional":"三、夏，四月，吳弒其君僚。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_208_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_208","textTraditional":"四、楚殺其大夫郤宛。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_208_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_208","textTraditional":"五、秋，晉士鞅、宋樂祁犁、衞北宮喜、曹人、邾人、滕人會於扈。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_208_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_208","textTraditional":"六、冬，十月，曹伯午卒。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_208_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_208","textTraditional":"七、邾快來奔。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_208_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_208","textTraditional":"八、公如齊。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_208_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_208","textTraditional":"九、公至自齊，居於鄆。","sentenceOrder":10}],"overrides":{}}